From 83072ec3ddab3e4712ce8db9ba232a10342557de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:31:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storage): map owned files through read-only backing
 references

Retain anonymous file identity across mediated writes and resizing.
Join private/read-only shared mapping to the current per-process task
transaction, retiring temporary descriptors and scratch before return.
Keep existing storage charging and native mapping behavior.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
